  "reason": "The study reports on the validation of a human AD model using iPSC-derived neurons and MEAs, and tests the efficacy of four AD therapeutics in this model. However, it does not report any quantitative measure of agreement between non-human animal results and human clinical results. The focus is on validating a human cell-based model and its use for therapeutic screening, not on comparing animal model performance to human outcomes."
